WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.367 --> 00:00:04.746
A privacy advisory site in eighteen languages and Hinglish,

2
00:00:04.746 --> 00:00:09.943
about five hundred and sixteen pages, that I have led since July 2026.

3
00:00:10.833 --> 00:00:14.488
Every page is prerendered in a real browser,

4
00:00:14.488 --> 00:00:19.305
so crawlers and AI tools read real text, not an empty app.

5
00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:22.562
The build is a chain of gates:

6
00:00:22.562 --> 00:00:27.757
locale parity, lint, types, build, prerender and an SEO validator.

7
00:00:27.757 --> 00:00:30.040
Any failure stops the deploy.

8
00:00:30.933 --> 00:00:33.846
When my own fallback once shipped empty pages,

9
00:00:33.846 --> 00:00:36.885
I owned it and made the build strict by default.

10
00:00:37.800 --> 00:00:45.611
On mobile, the largest content now appears in under four hundred milliseconds instead of about eight hundred and fifty,

11
00:00:45.611 --> 00:00:47.712
with ninety-seven on Lighthouse.

12
00:00:48.600 --> 00:00:50.808
The full case study is on my site.

